title: 'litep2p/req-resp: fix inbound request serve time reporting'
doc:
- audience: Node Operator
  description: |-
    The litep2p backend reported a near-zero serve time in the
    `substrate_sub_libp2p_requests_in_success_total` histogram, because the
    start time of an inbound request was taken only after the response was
    ready. The start time is now taken on arrival, matching the libp2p backend.
    Failures to send an outbound request are now counted in
    `requests_out_failure_total` instead of `requests_in_failure_total`.
crates:
- name: sc-network
  bump: patch
